   "widgets_values": [
    "",
    "Change the white T-shirt and blue jeans to the minimalist style in the right image, including a blazer and dress paired with sheer tights. The outfit consists of a blazer, dress, and transparent stockings. The blazer is black, with a clean design featuring a lapel and hidden front buttons, slightly loose cuffs for a relaxed feel. The inner layer is a sleeveless black dress, designed simply to follow body curves, knee-length to enhance elegance. The lower part features sheer stockings in black with glittering sequin decorations forming a dotted pattern, slimming the legs while adding a touch of glamour. The feet wear black high heels, coordinating with the rest of the outfit to elongate the leg lines. The overall look emphasizes fashion and individuality. Maintain the same facial features, hairstyle, and expression as in the left image. Completely remove the right image."
